  "prefLabel": "Tax 102.36 Property Tax appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.36 “Property Tax appeal” means an appeal involving ad valorem property taxes and includes claims of disproportionate assessment under RSA 51:7, RSA 76, RSA 71-B:16, RSA 75:14 and RSA 81:5.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.32); ss by 8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.36); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.38); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
